{
  "description": "HVL Interaktiv design tokens: the only source of colour (UD-001, D-072). Colours follow HVL's Profilmanual v2.0 (2017), p. 16 (D-017; HVL must still confirm, Q2). Typefaces follow D-018. Edit this file, then run `npm run tokens:build`.",
